<p>Haaye,<br> Zindaaa'n mein jab sakina ki jaa'n lab pe aagayi<br> boli wo roke kehde pidar se zara koi<br> hasrat thi nikli aapki godi dum mera<br> seene pe sar rakhu to mujhe chayn aaega<br> choome qadam sakina ke jhukkar jo maut ne<br> boli wo maa se amma karo qibla roo mujhe<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Ruk ruk ke saans aati hai kholo rasan zara<br> amma nikalne wala hai seene se dumm mera<br> kya is andhere ghar mein mujhe maut aayegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>2. Lele ke god mein mujhe roti hai kyu phuphi<br> kisse chhupa rahi yaha to koi nahi<br> taqdeer jaane ab kya sitam mujhpe dhaayegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>3. Phir rote rote aankh sakina ki jab lagi<br> dekha padar ko khwaab mein bachhi tadap uthi<br> boli sakina baba ke humraah jaayegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>4. Aaye the lene baba abhi to mujhe yaha<br> aye bibiyo batao pidar hai mere kaha<br> kehte the ab sakina mere saath jayegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>5. Ye sunke shor e girya utha yu ke al amaa'n<br> bheja yazeed ne sare shabbir nagahaa'n<br> qismat pidar se haaye ye kaise milayegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>6. Haye haye rage guloo se tapakta hai khoo'n abhi<br> baba pe mere kisne jafa is tarah se ki<br> sadma sakina ab ye utha bhi na payegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p> 
<p>7. Rehan jab sakina ne thama sare hussain<br> khamosh hogai wo raza karte karte bayn<br> bano ko muddato ye sada ab rulayegi<br> amma ye raat jaan meri leke jayegi<br> baba na aayenge, na mujhe neend aayegi..(2)</p>